# Bistro PH — environment variables
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_RESTAURANT_WHATSAPP_NUMBER
#   The destination WhatsApp number for demo orders.
#   Format: international, DIGITS ONLY — no "+", no spaces, no dashes.
#   Example: 639171234567
#
#   Leave this EMPTY (or set an invalid value) to run in demo mode: the site
#   shows a "copy order summary to clipboard" fallback instead of opening
#   WhatsApp. The app works with no environment variables set at all.
#
#   Never hardcode a real business number in the repository.
NEXT_PUBLIC_RESTAURANT_WHATSAPP_NUMBER=
